\pard\ltrpar\ql\f0 13.1 This agreement is governed by the laws of Ireland. The courts of Dublin, Ireland have exclusive jurisdiction, except that if you are a consumer you keep the protection of the mandatory laws of your country and may bring proceedings in the courts of your country of residence.\par\par
