\pard\ltrpar\ql\f0 13.3 The current version of this agreement is always available at https://texacore.ai/legal/eula/. A new version applies to updates that you install after it is published.\par\par
\pard\ltrpar\ql\f0 13.4 This is the entire agreement between you and us about the Software. If a part of it is found invalid, the rest remains in force.\par\par
